"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.poster.avif?t=1771945530\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.webm?t=1771945530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/fa62de73af8ada3ebf09e02ec6c9dc51.mp4?t=1771945530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udeb2 Wander freely across Kioku Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kioku is a cozy island made for wandering, with secrets tucked into every path and corner. Drift from town streets and the pier to forest trails, the mountain, and places that feel a little mysterious. If you follow your curiosity, you\u2019ll always find something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.poster.avif?t=1771945530\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.webm?t=1771945530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3283310/extras/72b25fb4f21609a6818bd8a7790a9c70.mp4?t=1771945530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f <strong>Exploration:</strong> Roam as Asti a cozy open island packed with secrets, shortcuts and surprises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 